    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόγονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>born</i> or <i>descended
				from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τλαύκου οὔτε τι ἀ. ἐστι</span> has no
				<i>descendant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.86
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ́</span>: in pl., <i>descendants,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.148
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.101
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαὶ . . ἀπόγονοι</span> thy
				<i>offspring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				534
			</span></i> (lyr.): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ἐφθαρμένου πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				53.65
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τέταρτος, ἕβδομος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					4.15.32
				</span></i>
			: fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπογόνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 No.<i><span class="en">
				176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>viable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.17
			</span></i>.</div>
